{"version":1,"key":"article:46","content":{"id":46,"title":"HTTPS","author":"","content":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65a412ce-a118-4ac5-add2-e3359c5159c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你使用 HTTP 访问网站或者进行通信，你的一切都毫无秘密 ，因为你的所有信息都是明文传输的，并且你收到的信息都可能是伪造的，想象你访问一个需要输入私密信息的网站，但是网站的内容已经被别人偷偷的篡改过了，你提交的信息都提交到别人的服务器上了，信息由此泄露。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ae452bee-14fd-4859-a975-5cc61f5ba3c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于 HTTP 是明文传输的，所有的内容没有经过任何的加密，截获到你传输流量的人，都可以从其中获取传递的信息，对付这种窃听，我们只需要对消息进行加密即可。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5b172789-f105-48ab-bf84-e644dedeef26","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"加密和解密都需要用到密钥，根据加密和解密使用的密钥是否相同，加密分为两种："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f2ff2535-f6ed-4c8c-bcb3-8e107051f81d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8e6a3f77-f9fe-42ff-8af4-b94c62cf1005","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1c14c798-ef44-4130-be36-cbcfed898d44","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对称加密：加解密使用同一个密钥"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"40d09e96-0bd8-4498-b65d-d34511aa9a22","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eda7cc70-f43c-4a2b-8d80-190a73bf2378","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非对称加密：加密和解密使用的不同的密钥"}]}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f40f6db4-d4f2-4204-aa7f-ab1b87901f23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非对称加密会生成两个密钥，使用其中一个加密，另外一个可以解密，且必须使用另外一个才能解密。这两个密钥其中一个是公开的，称之为公钥，另一个是绝不能在互联网上传播的，称之为私钥。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6b1cf41f-55e8-4c36-962a-1079ab50d1c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设我们对消息使用对称加密的方式进行加密，窃听者没有密钥，就无法解密了，但是你有没有想过一个问题，密钥要怎么传递，如果是明文传递，那么密钥也可以被窃听到，那么加密这件事就毫无意义。你可能会说，我们对密钥也进行加密，那么加密密钥的密钥如何传递，又回到了原点。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"725187d3-9e21-48b3-84dc-e65809e6e2d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个时候非对称加密要出场了，通信双方首先在本地生成公钥和私钥，然后互相把公钥发送给对方，让对方使用接收到的公钥加密消息，即使有窃听者，也只能获取到公钥，由于没有私钥，也无法解密消息。"}]},{"type":"mermaid","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    actor A\n    actor B\n    A->>A: 本地生成公钥 A 和 私钥 A\n    B->>B: 本地生成公钥 B 和 私钥 B\n    A->>B: 公钥 A\n    B->>A: 公钥 B\n    A->>A: 使用公钥 B 对 message1 加密 → Emessage1\n    A->>B: Emessage1\n    B->>B: 使用私钥 B 对 Emessage1 解密 → message1\n    B->>B: 使用公钥 A 对 message2 加密 → Emessage2\n    B->>A: Emessage2\n    A->>A: 使用私钥 A 对 Emessage2 解密 → message2","collabId":"bcd9c8c3-f18f-4f99-bf13-de0d1984ddc3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dfdf0694-ec3d-495e-b0c9-5f4ca8bd50b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非对称加密相对于对称加密的成本要高很多，要进行很复杂的运算，如果通信过程一直使用非对称加密，会使得通信时间变长，于是就有了混合加密，即通过非对称加密传递对称加密的密钥，然后使用对称加密的方式进行通信，因为对称加密的密钥是加密过的，因此窃听者无法得知，这种方式使成本和保密性都得到了保证。"}]},{"type":"mermaid","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    actor A\n    actor B\n    B->>A: 公钥\n    A->>A: 生成对称加密的密钥 key，并使用公钥加密 → EKey\n    A->>B: Ekey\n    B->>B: 使用私钥解密 → key","collabId":"ca7f00c7-be5e-48e8-9f60-a3ae481e3641","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"28cf719e-a84a-40b9-8d85-aaddd4499fdf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是非对称加密只是解决加密的问题，但无法确定对方的身份，即你怎么确认公钥一定是 B 发给你的呢？假设存在这么一个人，它劫持双方通信的流量，并且假冒是通信的对方，例如对于 A，它假冒是 B 与其交换密钥进行通信，对于 B，它假冒是 A 与其通信，所有的消息经过它进行了一次转发。"}]},{"type":"mermaid","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"sequenceDiagram\n\tactor A\n\tactor C\n\tactor B\n\tA-->C: key-AC\n\tC-->B: key-CB\n\tA->>C: key-AC + message1 → EMessage1\n\tC->>C: key-AC + EMessage1 → message1\n\tC->>B: key-CB + message1 → Emessage2\n\tB->>B: key-CB + Emessage2 → message1","collabId":"b1fdeb05-def3-4e9f-a93a-b2b7e055d5df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e279baaa-d734-41e5-be5c-4a77bd3b20b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"A 试图与 B 通信，但是被 C 劫持了，C 假冒 B 与 A 交换了密钥，同时假冒 A 与 B 交换了密钥，这样 A 与 B 之间的所有消息都会被 C 看到，这种攻击方式称为中间人攻击，很形象。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7bd58dc3-8241-4c7e-a5d5-82187e98f90c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之所以中间人有机可乘，是因为通信双方无法验证对方的身份，那如何证明身份呢，这就需要用到数字证书。数字证书需要向专门的机构（Certificate Authorities 机构，简称 CA）申请，我们需要提交我们的公钥、域名等信息给 CA 机构，并且还需要证明你的确是这个域名的持有者，CA 机构验证完成之后，会生成一个数字证书。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fd814063-27e5-455f-a534-91d6ce79a1c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时如果  A 向 B 请求信息，B 不应该直接返回它的公钥，而是返回申请的证书，浏览器会验证证书的合法性："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"521a34d4-8ec4-4787-851d-ed6f91c875e5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"20b8e100-5530-4da2-bc76-9c6c2cde74c1","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79f79225-9899-4bae-982b-fdf3e5bd04ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"证书是否是由可信任的 CA 机构颁发的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1fa4cf3b-de3c-4d6e-b953-517b89faa69a","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c37c8b77-20b6-4915-ac63-8f1a6756ad23","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"证书中的域名信息和当前请求的域名相吻合"}]}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cd35c25e-3fda-4861-b2ce-254d0a80fa9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是有一种可能，证书可能会被篡改，比如把证书里面的公钥替换为自己的，有什么办法可以知道消息被篡改了呢，那就是数字签名。CA 机构在颁发数字证书，还会生成一个数字签名，当浏览器收到证书后会计算证书的签名与下发的签名是否相同，如果相同则表示没有被修改，值得信任。那这个时候你就会问，数字签名不可以被篡改吗，还真的不能，只能由 CA 机构生成，其它生成的都无效，这又是为什么，这就要看数字签名是如何生成的："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"0458efc1-780e-4068-9b0d-d92669e858ba","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"3a75a05b-69d6-4a94-9053-9cb783659471","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe38fc25-f14d-41f2-ad1b-cc2f1d5b3c41","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CA 机构会生成一个公钥和私钥"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1e16869b-5915-412e-8c0a-492d00f72178","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b4790980-d22d-4d11-95d9-c397a6de81b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CA 机构会使用私钥对数字证书进行加密，得到的就是签名"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c94ee1be-f3c9-402f-80e7-9ec15eaa854b","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"11b30a4d-3b25-4554-a3bb-7aaeb202c558","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器使用 CA 机构的公钥进行解密，与签名进行比较，如果一样说明没被篡改"}]}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0fc3ce7d-ba7e-4d19-8a29-6c52bfe4bb70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为签名是使用 CA 机构的私钥加密的，而私钥只有 CA 机构有，别人无法生成签名，即使随便生成了一个，浏览器计算得到的签名肯定和这个签名对不上，就知道被篡改了。"}]},{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"a9dc8831-1f48-4ee5-af47-62ed46db6dfe","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9d61c94f-48b9-4a74-8fd4-82ff5021d407","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事实上，使用私钥对全部的消息进行加密比较耗费时间，一般是根据消息生成哈希值（相同的内容可以生成相同的哈希值，对内容篡改后，哈希值会大不相同），然后对哈希值加密得到数字签名。"}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ce091d78-332c-4315-8a63-5777a797a730","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"只有这三个条件都符合，我们才认可对方的身份，而不是第三方进行了伪造，然后就会提取证书中的域名提供的公钥。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8a721338-0949-4e89-b2e5-00fd2e20f137","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么中间人有没有可能伪造数字证书："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"a9a51e35-e597-4730-a183-e92cdda28219","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"185b2907-a167-4f64-bddb-fb46d9b6e3f5","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e9cfd454-7f36-4c3f-8430-95f4fc8cfe48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"申请一个别的域名的证书，替换为自己的"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"589ae8c0-b6ee-493a-9123-80a0e4f98910","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"浏览器会验证证书里面的域名与请求的域名是否吻合，域名信息不对，会被认为是不安全的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9c427fcb-0b89-4d4f-8e86-10645475c5ca","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2cd5af73-c8d6-49ba-90e4-d1d60beb53f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"也向机构申请一个证书，并且声明自己是这个域名的持有者"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d565dcff-1377-45da-bba4-fd5fad628ab2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无法证明是域名的持有者，CA 会给一个记录让你配置在域名相关信息中，因为你不是域名的所有制，自然无法配置，所以不会颁发证书"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8c37c35d-d245-40c6-bcf0-d6d4c1891b86","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c9684898-7a3a-4a10-9596-89142974c7a2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"篡改证书信息"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a0f2fed-22ec-4d30-906e-bf835cd8acfe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"证书使用 CA 机构的私钥进行了签名，篡改了信息就无法使签名与篡改后的签名一致"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"198fef93-b9c2-45ef-94a8-cbdfd0b26067","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"把签名也篡改了？没有 CA 机构的私钥，无法篡改"}]}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f2458e0-8318-41ab-ad6b-aa2bf02f36a8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以 HTTPS 的总体通信如下"}]},{"type":"mermaid","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"sequenceDiagram\n\tactor 浏览器\n\tactor 服务器\n\t浏览器->>服务器: Hello\n\t服务器->>浏览器: 证书\n\t浏览器->>浏览器: 验证证书合法性，提取服务器的公钥 pubKey\n\t浏览器->>浏览器: 生成对称加密的密钥 key，使用公钥加密 pubKey + key → Ekey\n\t浏览器->>服务器: Ekey\n\t服务器->>服务器: 使用私钥解密 priKey + Ekey → key\n\tNote over 浏览器,服务器: 愉快的使用 key 进行加密通信\n","collabId":"11d6a6ae-4da7-4afb-927c-81daf546da19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a1fff70c-fe63-4cf5-b716-f5499686f1c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后还有一个值得注意的问题，浏览器是如何获得 CA 机构的公钥的，你无法保证 CA 机构的公钥不是伪造的，其实 CA 机构的公钥也是以证书的形式交付给浏览器的，那么问题来了，这个证书是谁生成的，其实 CA 机构也是有层级的，这个证书是由上一级的 CA 机构颁发，处于最上级的 CA 机构称为根 CA 机构，它们的证书是谁颁发的呢，是它们自己，自己给自己颁发证书，这种证书称为自签名的证书。"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8ea96752-71a8-423d-b656-1e093e8d28c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你收到了一个自签名的证书，但不是根 CA 机构的，那么你就要注意了，如果信任该证书，且该机构包含恶意，你的信息可能被其监听到，甚至被修改，所以对于不信任的证书不要添加到信任列表中。"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"999ccc72-14cb-4769-ba7b-5b2df984f2cb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"21dca7d6-f8e4-4942-9dcd-24f881d38ec2","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a7f4fd32-40b3-4923-b9cc-98951d551fae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有了 HTTPS，使用公共场所的 WiFi 还安全吗"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"119f70ab-dd5f-408d-b8e3-1d736f38a325","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你使用的 HTTPS 那就没问题，虽然能看到你发送的所有字节，但是不知道你们交流了什么。但是如果你使用了 HTTP，你的内容可以被看到，甚至返回的内容都会被修改，使得你提交的内容会指向一个不安全的网站"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"58fdd5ab-d46d-4678-9ddc-fd19ce3d40b3","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f49727da-db6d-40ae-b923-0773ed478295","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"公司能监控到你的 HTTPS 内容吗"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1cff8c9a-2619-4d52-b653-0e13b0332d4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在每个信任链的根部都有一个隐含的受信任的 CA，这些权威机构的列表存储在你的浏览器中。你的公司可以利用他们对你的机器的访问，将他们自己的自签名证书添加到这个 CA 列表中。然后，他们可以拦截你所有的 HTTPS 请求，对于一些网站的证书，由他们的假 CA 签署。由于你使用的是公司提供的证书中的公钥对你的所有 HTTPS 请求进行加密，他们可以使用相应的私钥来解密和检查（甚至修改）你的请求，然后将其发送到预定地点。他们可能不会这样做，但他们可以。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"37451358-be93-4f3f-afdb-6bbea357b9e6","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"efd1dedb-9da3-4742-8228-66c42b0b5bea","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"棱镜门事件"}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be7e6a75-70c6-4033-be60-a9eb7d44055d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"法官要求公司交出它们的私钥，有了私钥，就可以解密出加密使用的密钥，所有的消息都会被看到。"}]}]}]},{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20f76dfd-b383-4c2d-944a-20a7cabfd12d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考资料："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"957b254a-98d0-4e3e-af5d-33ed22855929","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a1042c46-3e41-4feb-b070-534a4c076e4e","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"96feb2e9-f723-4acf-bffd-00253adcc1bc","children":[{"openEdit":false,"type":"link","url":"https://robertheaton.com/2014/03/27/how-does-https-actually-work/","tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"742a0b50-b109-4b82-adee-1aea499b7f20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"https://robertheaton.com/2014/03/27/how-does-https-actually-work/"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"43958368-e69f-4ec4-988f-46be849af45e","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64140e9d-7c72-4bab-95eb-2088244f4538","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《我的第一本算法书》"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fdc1cd57-9b1d-48c1-b08b-9d3365117c50","children":[{"disableDrag":false,"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d536c7e5-fda5-470b-9a0f-51f92b95f82e","children":[{"openEdit":false,"type":"link","url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/keyless-ssl-the-nitty-gritty-technical-details/","tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"f7fdda9e-0c8d-4cd4-a15f-002606d0d02a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/keyless-ssl-the-nitty-gritty-technical-details/"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C__Users_pc_.editor_resources_Snipaste_2024-10-09_14-27-39_f0ea5128-1ada-4f4b-a069-b20f4c3c6259_6eb7c8ba-b1eb-47c7-9a2f-a101d8c1030e.png","createTime":1714632294493,"updateTime":1789294399950},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1789294399950}}